  "summary": "This single-sheet Lok Sabha corrigenda, dated 7 December 1970, records four corrections to the text of *The Salaries and Allowances of Ministers Bill, 1970*, introduced by N. Dandekar and M. R. Masani, M.P.s. It amends one word on page 6, corrects two numerical expressions on page 7, and directs that the line numbers on page 2 be corrected.\n\nThe sheet is a technical legislative errata notice rather than a statement of the Bill's policy or rationale. The underlying Bill is not included in the rendered document.",
